    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105562" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφ-ῖτις</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγραφή,</span> contract <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>providing for aliment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				51.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				776.8
			</span></i> (both <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMich.Teb.</u>
				121vi6
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνὴ
			τ.</span> either a <i>wet-nurse</i> (so <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				37.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>), or a <i>wife married according to a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγραφὴ τ.,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>PGiss.</u>
				37 ii 13
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				36.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. γῆ</span> dub. sens. in <i><span class="en">
